  "notes": "This show featured the Phish debuts of When the Cactus is in Bloom and Alaska. Before Dog Faced Boy, Trey explained that while living with Fish, he wrote Dog Faced Boy, Tube and Gumbo based on entries in one of Fish\u2019s journals. During Dog Faced Boy, Fish left his drum kit and lay down in front of the stage because he didn\u2019t need to sing the song. Lengthwise (performed <em>a cappella</em>) was played for the first time since July 28, 1998 (235 shows). Bold as Love was played for the first time since October 6, 2000 (74 shows).",
